  "term": "cerebral infection",
  "definition": "Cerebral infection is infection involving the brain. In this source, it refers to Trypanosoma brucei infection of the brain, where parasites and T cells enter brain regions early and contribute to local inflammatory, metabolic, and sleep-related changes.",
